{"1938750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Out of Stock!", "steam_appid": 1938750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938750/extras/71d85faa7a8b5e64b18e704d177cf858.avif?t=1764766581\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Out of Stock!</strong> is a frantic cooperative party game for 1 to 4 players. Team up with your friends and step into the shoes of overwhelmed sellers. Order new stock, refill the shelves, clean up spills and check out customers fast, before they get angry and storm out !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cooperative (in)experienced sellers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Divide the work efficiently with your friends, manage your time to serve as many customers as possible and throw boxes around to stay ahead of the chaos. But most importantly : NEVER do anything that could upset a customer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938750/extras/de2b385603937a79777b11cbe6195f9b.poster.avif?t=1764766581\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938750/extras/de2b385603937a79777b11cbe6195f9b.webm?t=1764766581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crazy customers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers are your top priority, so don't let them have a bad shopping experience ! Make sure the shelves are always stocked, and the floors are spotless. Each customer has a unique trait : Some take a lot of articles at once, some fall easily on dirty floor, while others get angry fast,<i> really</i> fast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938750/extras/35e91bdf27245571a74709178fcca33c.poster.avif?t=1764766581\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938750/extras/35e91bdf27245571a74709178fcca33c.webm?t=1764766581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize your seller</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your style with dozens of different hats, haircuts and skin tones. Create your perfect store clerk and get ready to charm your customers !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938750/extras/4b13f20c688d87fd9cc23c2ce503a45b.poster.avif?t=1764766581\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938750/extras/4b13f20c688d87fd9cc23c2ce503a45b.webm?t=1764766581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New worlds to visit</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your teamwork to the test in a variety of environments, each with its own challenges. Adapt your strategy to conveyor belts, tricky store layouts, demanding customers, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938750/extras/9d3ca06bb289a6066f4557f8862cd839.poster.avif?t=1764766581\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938750/extras/9d3ca06bb289a6066f4557f8862cd839.webm?t=1764766581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></spa